| Graph model | Nodes, edges, evidence, abstraction levels |
| Visualization | Architecture maps, call graphs, dependency graphs |
| Exploration | Progressive expansion and impact analysis |
| Evidence | File paths, source locations, explanations |
| Uncertainty | How unresolved relationships are handled |
| Execution requirements | Whether repository code or build tools are executed |
